### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
### AI Rewrite API Tests
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@apiKey = REDACTED_API_KEY

### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 1. Basic Request
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor/ai-rewrite
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "sentence": "So 12% risk of death from prostate cancer at 15 years is small in the grand scheme of things.",
  "class_": "1"
}

### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 2. With Target Score - target_score 
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor/ai-rewrite
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "sentence": "So 12% risk of death from prostate cancer at 15 years is small in the grand scheme of things.",
  "class_": "1",
  "target_score": 5
}

### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 3. With Context
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor/ai-rewrite
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "sentence": "So 12% risk of death from prostate cancer at 15 years is small in the grand scheme of things.",
  "class_": "1",
  "target_score": 5,
  "context": "I hope you're not going to die of your cancer, I want to prevent that. So of course everyone who gets diagnosed with cancer wants to know what is the risk that the cancer will harm them. We know this data from studies looking at risk of cancer death in men who chose not to treat their cancers. In your case, that risk turns out to be 12% at 15 years. So 12% risk of death from prostate cancer at 15 years is small in the grand scheme of things, but it's a little bit too high for doctors."
}

### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 4. Class 1 - Cancer Prognosis
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor/ai-rewrite
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "sentence": "The cancer might spread.",
  "class_": "1",
  "target_score": 5
}

### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 5. Class 2 - Life Expectancy
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor/ai-rewrite
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "sentence": "You have a long time to live.",
  "class_": "2",
  "target_score": 5
}

### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 6. Class 3 - Erectile Dysfunction
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor/ai-rewrite
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "sentence": "There is risk of ED.",
  "class_": "3",
  "target_score": 5
}

### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 7. Class 4 - Urinary Incontinence
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor/ai-rewrite
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "sentence": "You might need pads.",
  "class_": "4",
  "target_score": 5
}

### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 8. Class 5 - Irritative Symptoms
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor/ai-rewrite
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "sentence": "You may have urinary symptoms.",
  "class_": "5",
  "target_score": 5
}

### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 9. Error Test - Missing API Key (Expect 403)
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor/ai-rewrite
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sentence": "Test sentence",
  "class_": "1"
}

### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 10. Error Test - Invalid API Key (Expect 403)
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor/ai-rewrite
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: wrong-api-key

{
  "sentence": "Test sentence",
  "class_": "1"
}

### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### 11. Error Test - Missing Required Field (Expect 422)
### ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/doctor/ai-rewrite
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "sentence": "Test sentence"
}


